
== a quote pinned to tariff version 1
{
    "api_version": 1,
    "status": "ok",
    "quote": {
        "carrier_id": "acme",
        "service_id": "ground",
        "tariff_version": 1,
        "zone": "zone-a",
        "actual_weight_g": 1200,
        "dimensional_weight_g": 1200,
        "billed_weight_g": 1200,
        "base_charge_minor": 900,
        "minimum_charge_applied": true,
        "fuel_surcharge_minor": 108,
        "accessorial_charges_minor": [
            [
                "liftgate",
                250
            ]
        ],
        "total_minor": 1258
    }
}
   -> the caller pays 1258 minor units

   as of instant 1500 the tariff is version 2, and the price is 1358

== a zone this tariff does not price
{
    "api_version": 1,
    "status": "rejected",
    "error": {
        "code": "unavailable_zone",
        "fields": {
            "carrier_id": "acme",
            "service_id": "ground",
            "tariff_version": 1,
            "zone": "zone-nowhere"
        }
    }
}

   a negative weight is refused before anything is priced: request: actual_weight_g cannot be negative

== a policy decision, with the rule that made it
{
    "api_version": 1,
    "status": "ok",
    "decision": {
        "scope": "hazmat",
        "allowed": false,
        "citation": {
            "rule_id": "no-hazmat-air",
            "version": 1,
            "action": "reject",
            "priority": 10,
            "reason": "class 1.4 is not accepted on air services"
        }
    }
}

   nothing matched, so the shipment is allowed with no citation: null

== catalog version metadata
{
    "api_version": 1,
    "status": "ok",
    "catalog": {
        "catalog_id": "dc-12",
        "version": 2,
        "effective_at": 900,
        "published_at": 900,
        "resolved_at": 1700,
        "rolled_back_from": 1,
        "note": "revert the weight correction",
        "entry_counts": {
            "items": 1,
            "cartons": 1,
            "pallets": 0,
            "exclusions": 0,
            "overrides": 0
        },
        "item_ids": [
            "sku-1"
        ],
        "carton_ids": [
            "box-m"
        ],
        "pallet_ids": []
    }
}

   version 2 is a rollback of version 1

== the canonical form is what you store, log and compare
{"api_version":1,"quote":{"accessorial_charges_minor":[["liftgate",250]],"actual_weight_g":1200,"base_charge_minor":900,"billed_weight_g":1200,"carrier_id":"acme","dimensional_weight_g":1200,"fuel_surcharge_minor":108,"minimum_charge_applied":true,"service_id":"ground","tariff_version":1,"total_minor":1258,"zone":"zone-a"},"status":"ok"}
